SCOPE NOTE / 적용 범위

This MIT license covers the skill itself — SKILL.md, its rules, structure and
Korean commentary.

It does NOT cover the twelve English source prompts reproduced in
golden-prompts.md. Those are generations from Higgsfield's official account
(@skxqw, "Soul Carousels") and are included as reference material for gauging
prompt density. Rights to those texts remain with their original author.
Source: https://higgsfield.ai/@skxqw/projects/soul-carousels

이 MIT 라이선스는 스킬 본체(SKILL.md의 규칙·구조·한국어 해설)에만 적용됩니다.
golden-prompts.md에 실린 영어 원문 12편은 적용 대상이 아니며, 그 권리는 원
작성자에게 있습니다.
